      "message": "Does this end up adjacent to soong_metrics and other logs, as the bug suggests?\n\nIt looks like the other path determination logic uses a \"logs prefix\", which is omitted here. \nExample:\nhttps://cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/+/master:build/soong/cmd/soong_ui/main.go;l\u003d229;drc\u003d3c0fe0edc0aa5332f7ad23af13b75cd13cab1fb8",
