      "writtenOn": "2021-11-23T22:03:31Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The build log is dumped to `out/`, as is the `build_progress.pb`. AFAICT, there is no `soong_metrics`, `logs` or otherwise. In fact, there is no `logs` AFAICT in `out/`.\n\nYes, I have brought that up a few times. The best response I got was you pointing out the local variables at the top of `soong_build/main.go`, hence my use of `{top,out}Dir`.",
      "parentUuid": "a672f09b_828911fc",
      "revId": "6948f2d22a5fe1467d87e5d6fc47165f41991186",
