      "writtenOn": "2021-11-24T17:29:02Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "As far as I know, there is nothing currently available in the scope of soong_build that gives you the exact analogue; you may have to wire this in to the environment of soong_build.\n\nI would look to what we do for BAZEL_METRICS_DIR, which we determine in soong_ui using LogsDir, forward to soong_build, which then forwards it to its Bazel invocation.\n\nHere\u0027s a soong_ui pointer: \n\nhttps://cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/+/master:build/soong/ui/build/soong.go;l\u003d358;drc\u003da64bd73b1873ca7cb056fc29bef476774f0d3359\n\nLet me know if you have any questions about this approach I\u0027m proposing. Feel free to think of alternatives, too.",
      "parentUuid": "e59bcec0_6c965236",
      "revId": "6948f2d22a5fe1467d87e5d6fc47165f41991186",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
